2
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:05,000
星炎 Fierstra・Diva 虎金妃笑虎 3D Live 2026
[Title: Fierstra Diva - Niko Koganei 3D Live 2026]

3
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:49,200
幾千の
Across thousands of...

4
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:53,200
時を巡って今
...moments in time, now

5
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:56,900
僕ら出会えたの
we were able to meet.

6
00:04:56,900 --> 00:05:01,100
ほら 見失わないように
Look, so that we don't lose each other,

7
00:05:01,100 --> 00:05:01,800
手を
take my hand...

8
00:05:02,538 --> 00:05:07,588
離さないで
Don't let me go...

9
00:05:09,688 --> 00:05:14,588
Ah...

10
00:05:24,788 --> 00:05:28,788
耳を澄ませて
Listen closely,

11
00:05:28,888 --> 00:05:34,088
星の降る音が聞こえるでしょう
you can hear the sound of falling stars, can't you?

12
00:05:34,188 --> 00:05:38,288
もっと近くに来て
Come a little closer,

13
00:05:38,388 --> 00:05:43,788
誰も知らない世界が待ってるの
a world no one knows is waiting.

14
00:05:43,888 --> 00:05:48,088
手を取って踊りましょう
Take my hand and let's dance,

15
00:05:48,188 --> 00:05:52,088
始まりの合図鳴らせば
once we sound the signal to begin.

16
00:05:52,188 --> 00:05:57,088
歌おう lalala 響け lalala
Let's sing, lalala, let it echo, lalala,

17
00:05:57,188 --> 00:06:00,788
暗がりの道も
even along this dark path,

18
00:06:00,888 --> 00:06:05,288
月明かりが照らすの
the moonlight will shine down.

19
00:06:06,788 --> 00:06:11,088
空、海の向こう
Beyond the sky and the sea,

20
00:06:11,188 --> 00:06:17,288
君の元まで響くように歌えるかな
can I sing so it reaches all the way to you?

21
00:06:17,488 --> 00:06:21,088
どんな時も
No matter the time,

22
00:06:21,188 --> 00:06:27,088
ここに立ってるよ 祈っているからさ
I'll be standing right here, praying for you.

23
00:06:27,288 --> 00:06:33,088
ほら キラキラ輝く星は
Look, the glittering, sparkling stars,

24
00:06:33,188 --> 00:06:40,288
色褪せず 太古から照らし続けてる
never fading, have shone since ancient times.

25
00:06:40,388 --> 00:06:46,488
君と辿り着けるさ
Together with you, we can make it there.

26
00:06:55,288 --> 00:06:59,088
心には会いたい
In my heart, there's someone I want to see—

27
00:06:59,188 --> 00:07:04,288
誰かがいて羅針盤みたいね
just like a compass guiding me.

28
00:07:04,488 --> 00:07:08,588
そっと目を開けてみて
Gently open your eyes and see;

29
00:07:08,688 --> 00:07:14,088
見えるものだけがリアルじゃないの
what is visible isn't all that is real.

30
00:07:14,188 --> 00:07:18,288
君といる世界は
The world I share with you

31
00:07:18,388 --> 00:07:22,288
永遠の記憶に眠るのさ
slumbers within eternal memories.

32
00:07:22,388 --> 00:07:27,288
歌おう nanana 響け nanana
Let's sing, nanana, let it echo, nanana,

33
00:07:27,388 --> 00:07:34,788
潮の満ち引きが道引いてくれるの
the ebb and flow of the tide will guide our way.

34
00:07:35,488 --> 00:07:40,488
途切れかけた夢を見ても
Even if you dream of a fading dream,

35
00:07:40,588 --> 00:07:45,288
大丈夫 一人にはしないよ
it's okay, I won't leave you alone.

36
00:07:45,388 --> 00:07:54,788
何度だって 互いの引力で引き寄せ合うんだよ
Time and again, each other's gravity will pull us together.

37
00:07:55,688 --> 00:08:00,088
空、海の匂い
The scent of the sky and the sea—

38
00:08:00,188 --> 00:08:06,488
君に届いたかな 距離なんてないのかな
did it reach you? Maybe distance doesn't exist at all.

39
00:08:06,688 --> 00:08:10,488
どんな時も
No matter the time,

40
00:08:10,588 --> 00:08:16,088
きっとどこかで 見守っているからさ
I'll surely be watching over you from somewhere.

41
00:08:16,188 --> 00:08:21,088
ほら くしゃくしゃになって笑う
Look, smiling with a crinkled face,

42
00:08:21,188 --> 00:08:26,088
陽を集めて紡いだ未来
a future woven by gathering sunlight.

43
00:08:26,188 --> 00:08:30,088
踏み出す先も君と
Wherever we step forward, together with you,

44
00:08:30,188 --> 00:08:38,088
心震わせて
let our hearts tremble.

45
00:08:43,088 --> 00:08:53,788
重なる星座 今 物語を巡ろう
Overlapping constellations, let's journey through this story now.

46
00:09:03,288 --> 00:09:06,088
ニコたんが来たー！
Nico-tan is here!

47
00:09:06,188 --> 00:09:10,088
hololive DEV_IS FLOW GLOWのお笑い担当、虎金妃ニコです！
I'm Koganei Nico, in charge of comedy for hololive DEV_IS FLOW GLOW!

48
00:09:10,188 --> 00:09:14,088
ニコたんだよー！誕生日だー！がるるるるー！
It's Nico-tan! It's my birthday! Grrrrr!

49
00:09:14,188 --> 00:09:20,488
ニコたん初の生誕ライブ「星苑 -FYRASTRA DIVA-」にご来場いただき、ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for coming to Nico-tan's very first birthday live, "Seien -FYRASTRA DIVA-"!

50
00:09:20,788 --> 00:09:26,688
本日のハッシュタグは #ニコたん生たん2026！「たん」はニコたんの「たん」なので平仮名です！
Today's hashtag is #ニコたん生たん2026! The "tan" is from "Nico-tan," so it's in hiragana!

51
00:09:26,788 --> 00:09:32,088
こちらでね、スクショたくさん撮って感想どしどしポストしてください！頼んます！
Take lots of screenshots and post tons of your thoughts using it! Countin' on ya!

52
00:09:32,288 --> 00:09:37,088
今回のタイトル「星苑 -FYRASTRA DIVA-」、こちらは——
As for today's title, "Seien -FYRASTRA DIVA-," this is—

53
00:09:37,188 --> 00:09:44,788
FYRASTRA！炎、星、虎の3つの要素を掛け合わせたトリプルミーニング！ニコたんが作っちゃいました！
FYRASTRA! A triple meaning combining flame, star, and tiger! Nico-tan made it up herself!

54
00:09:44,988 --> 00:09:49,288
まあ、ニコたんが星で、で、みんなから炎もらってて、みたいな。
Well, like Nico-tan is the star, and I'm receiving flames from all of you, y'know?

55
00:09:49,388 --> 00:09:53,088
フェスでさ、初めてのフェスでみんなのペンライト赤かったりしたでしょ？
At the fest, my first fest, everyone's penlights were red, right?

56
00:09:53,188 --> 00:09:58,088
あれはね、炎だったの！このライブの匂わせをしていたわけです！計画通りってわけですよ！
That was actually flames! I was dropping hints about this live show! All according to plan!

57
00:09:58,288 --> 00:10:04,088
今回はたくさんのDIVAたちと、そんなニコたんの炎を感じられるような感じでたくさん歌...
Today, together with lots of DIVAs, in a way where you can feel Nico-tan's fiery passion, lots of sing—

58
00:10:04,269 --> 00:10:06,769
歌っていく歌唱メインのライブになっております！
This live show is all about singing!

59
00:10:07,069 --> 00:10:10,269
1曲目は「星降る海」を歌わせていただきました！
For the first song, I performed "Hoshifuru Umi"!

60
00:10:10,469 --> 00:10:14,469
皆さんどうでしたでしょうか？ニコたん清楚でしたでしょうか？
How did everyone like it? Was Nikotan pure and elegant?

61
00:10:14,769 --> 00:10:17,269
このあとはゲストのディーヴァたちとの時間です！
Up next is our time with the guest divas!

62
00:10:17,469 --> 00:10:20,269
それではゲストパート、レッツゴー！
And now for the guest segment, let's go!

63
00:10:29,469 --> 00:10:34,069
涙が夜に溶けて 空が今日も遠くなる
Tears dissolve into the night, and today the sky feels so far away again

64
00:10:34,269 --> 00:10:38,769
未来が閉じたように 暗闇が満ちている
As if the future has closed up, darkness fills the space

65
00:10:39,269 --> 00:10:43,769
あぁ 醜い心も かすれそうな言葉も
Ah, my unsightly heart and my faint, trembling words...

66
00:10:44,069 --> 00:10:50,769
すべて見透かしたように 星が輝いていた
As if seeing right through everything, the stars were shining

67
00:11:11,069 --> 00:11:15,269
夜鷹のように高く 空を駆けていけたら
If only I could fly high through the sky like a nighthawk

68
00:11:15,469 --> 00:11:20,469
綺麗だって囃されて 特別になれたのに
I would have been hailed as beautiful and become special

69
00:11:20,669 --> 00:11:25,269
そう うつむいた目には 憧れしか映らない
Yes, in my downcast eyes, only longing is reflected

70
00:11:25,469 --> 00:11:30,469
誰かの描いた地図じゃ 灯る場所は探せない
On a map drawn by someone else, I can't find where to shine

71
00:11:30,669 --> 00:11:35,069
あぁ 僕らの現状は 意地らしくフラットして
Ah, our reality is stubbornly flat

72
00:11:35,269 --> 00:11:40,769
気を抜けば明日が 昨日になってしまう
If we let our guard down, tomorrow turns into yesterday

73
00:11:40,769 --> 00:11:46,769
これはそう今日を諦めなかった故のストーリー
This is a story born from not giving up on today

74
00:11:46,769 --> 00:11:51,769
風切り羽響かせて 空を目指して
Letting our flight feathers echo, aiming for the sky

75
00:11:51,869 --> 00:11:56,769
惨めになって嫌になったって 輝いてる夢を
Even if I feel miserable and disgusted, the shining dream...

76
00:11:56,869 --> 00:12:01,469
叶える羽は とうのとうに生えていた
The wings to fulfill it had sprouted long ago

77
00:12:01,669 --> 00:12:06,269
吐き出す息が白寒めて 声も聞こえなくなって
The exhaled breath turns chilly white, voice no longer heard

78
00:12:06,369 --> 00:12:11,069
燃え上がる体温が 夜空を焦がすまで
Until our burning warmth scorches the night sky

79
00:12:11,169 --> 00:12:14,769
誰よりももっともっと向こうへって
Reaching further beyond than anyone else

80
00:12:14,869 --> 00:12:20,269
羽ばたいた星の 一瞬を
The fleeting instant of a fluttering star

81
00:12:20,469 --> 00:12:26,069
あぁ 夜空はずっと待っている 灯る日を待っている
Ah, the night sky is always waiting, waiting for the day it lights up

82
00:12:26,269 --> 00:12:32,269
きっと きっと
Surely, surely...

83
00:12:36,269 --> 00:12:40,969
いつかなんてごまかして 誰かに擦り付けて
Deceiving myself with "someday", blaming it on someone else

84
00:12:41,069 --> 00:12:45,769
どこかなんて慰めて 何かに縋っている
Comforting myself with "somewhere", clinging onto something

85
00:12:45,969 --> 00:12:50,669
あぁ それこそが僕だ 汚れきった心だ
Ah, that is truly who I am, a completely stained heart

86
00:12:50,769 --> 00:12:55,769
夜鷹にはなれないな だから今日を飛んだんだ
I can never be a nighthawk, that's why I took flight today

87
00:12:55,869 --> 00:13:00,269
あぁ 僕らの結末は 面白いほどナーバスで
Ah, our conclusion is amusingly nervous

88
00:13:00,469 --> 00:13:06,769
予測なんて一つも 当てにならないから
Because not a single prediction can be counted on

89
00:13:06,769 --> 00:13:11,769
これはまだ僕を諦めなかった故のストーリー
This is a story born from still not giving up on myself

90
00:13:11,769 --> 00:13:16,769
枯れた喉を響かせて 後悔を追い越して
Letting parched throats resonate, overtaking regret

91
00:13:16,869 --> 00:13:21,669
世界にとって僕にとって 不相応だった役なんて
A role unfitting for this world and unfitting for me...

92
00:13:21,769 --> 00:13:26,469
いらない 知らない 所詮僕は僕だった
I don't need it, don't care, after all I was just me

93
00:13:26,669 --> 00:13:31,269
それならどうかこの涙を忘れないで
If that's the case, please never forget these tears

94
00:13:31,469 --> 00:13:36,269
疲れ果ててこの空から 落ちるまで
Until I am completely exhausted and fall from this sky

95
00:13:36,469 --> 00:13:40,269
今よりももっともっと向こうへって
Reaching even further beyond than where I am now

96
00:13:40,369 --> 00:13:45,769
羽ばたいた星が 泣いている
The fluttering stars are weeping

97
00:13:45,869 --> 00:13:48,769
あぁ 夜空が白み出している
Ah, the night sky begins to dawn white

98
00:13:48,769 --> 00:13:52,769
日が昇りだしている そっと
The sun is gently beginning to rise

99
00:14:01,269 --> 00:14:06,069
あれから始まって これから終わっていく
It started back then, and will come to an end from here on

100
00:14:06,269 --> 00:14:11,069
ひとつ ひとつ 一瞬を 確かめていく
One by one, verifying each fleeting instant

101
00:14:11,269 --> 00:14:16,069
誰とも同じじゃない 誰にも似ていない
Not the same as anyone, not resembling anybody

102
00:14:16,269 --> 00:14:21,469
ひとり ひとり とても不確かな空を飛んでいるのさ
Each of us is flying through this very uncertain sky

103
00:14:21,669 --> 00:14:26,269
僕らの現状は 気持ちひとつでシャープして
Our reality sharpens with a single change of feeling

104
00:14:26,469 --> 00:14:32,269
怯えていた明日を 昨日に変えてしまえる
We can turn the tomorrow we feared into yesterday

105
00:14:32,269 --> 00:14:37,769
これはそう今日を諦めなかった故のストーリー
This is a story born from not giving up on today

106
00:14:37,769 --> 00:14:42,469
風切り羽響かせて 空を目指して
Letting our flight feathers echo, aiming for the sky

107
00:14:42,569 --> 00:14:47,469
惨めになって嫌になったって 輝いてる夢を
Even if I feel miserable and disgusted, the shining dream...

108
00:14:47,569 --> 00:14:52,069
叶える羽は とうのとうに生えていた
The wings to fulfill it had sprouted long ago

109
00:14:52,269 --> 00:14:57,069
吐き出す息が白寒めて 声も聞こえなくなって
The exhaled breath turns chilly white, voice no longer heard

110
00:14:57,169 --> 00:15:01,269
燃え上がる体温が 夜空を焦がすまで
Until our burning warmth scorches the night sky

111
00:15:01,584 --> 00:15:08,084
誰よりもっと もっと向こうへ 羽ばたいた星の一瞬が
Farther than anyone, soaring far beyond, that fleeting moment of a star...

112
00:15:08,084 --> 00:15:11,084
Woo...

113
00:15:11,184 --> 00:15:14,284
暗い夜空を照らし出している
Illuminates the dark night sky,

114
00:15:14,284 --> 00:15:17,084
淡く光っている
glowing faintly.

115
00:15:17,084 --> 00:15:24,584
ずっと... ずっと... ずっと...
Forever... forever... forever...

116
00:16:00,584 --> 00:16:08,084
Yariya... Yae...

117
00:16:08,584 --> 00:16:16,084
Yariya... Yae...

118
00:16:16,084 --> 00:16:21,784
いつか君が瞳に灯す 愛の光が
Someday, the light of love you kindle in your eyes

119
00:16:21,784 --> 00:16:24,084
時を超えて
will transcend time,

120
00:16:24,084 --> 00:16:29,084
滅び急ぐ世界の夢を 確かに一つ
and surely destroy one dream

121
00:16:29,084 --> 00:16:31,584
壊すだろう
of this world rushing toward ruin.

122
00:16:31,584 --> 00:16:34,784
躊躇いを飲み干して
Swallow down your hesitation;

123
00:16:34,784 --> 00:16:38,584
君が望むモノは何？
what is it that you wish for?

124
00:16:38,584 --> 00:16:41,884
こんな欲深い憧れの行方に
At the end of such greedy longing,

125
00:16:41,884 --> 00:16:47,084
儚い明日はあるの？
will there be a fleeting tomorrow?

126
00:16:48,584 --> 00:16:56,084
子供の頃夢に見てた 古の魔法のように
Like the ancient magic I dreamed of as a child,

127
00:16:56,084 --> 00:17:03,884
闇さえ砕く力で 微笑む君に会いたい
with a power that can shatter even darkness, I want to see you smile.

128
00:17:03,884 --> 00:17:11,084
怯えるこの手の中には 手折られた花の勇気
Held within these trembling hands is the courage of a plucked flower.

129
00:17:11,084 --> 00:17:15,584
想いだけが頼る全て
My feelings are all that I rely on,

130
00:17:15,584 --> 00:17:19,584
光を呼び覚ます
awakening the light,

131
00:17:19,584 --> 00:17:28,084
願い...
this wish...

132
00:17:29,084 --> 00:17:34,584
いつか君も誰かの為に 強い力を
Someday, you too will wish for great strength

133
00:17:34,584 --> 00:17:37,084
望むのだろう
for someone else's sake.

134
00:17:37,084 --> 00:17:42,384
愛が胸を捉えた夜に 未知の言葉が
On the night when love seizes your heart, unknown words

135
00:17:42,384 --> 00:17:44,584
生まれて来る
will be born.

136
00:17:44,584 --> 00:17:50,384
迷わずに行けるなら 心が砕けてもいいわ
If I can go on without hesitation, I don't mind if my heart breaks.

137
00:17:50,384 --> 00:17:55,784
いつも目の前の哀しみに
To confront the sorrow

138
00:17:55,784 --> 00:17:59,784
立ち向かうための呪文が欲しい
that always lies before my eyes, I want a spell.

139
00:18:01,584 --> 00:18:09,084
君はまだ夢見る記憶 私は眠らない明日
You are a memory still dreaming; I am a sleepless tomorrow.

140
00:18:09,084 --> 00:18:16,784
二人が出会う奇跡を 勝ち取るために進むわ
I will move forward to seize the miracle of our meeting.

141
00:18:16,784 --> 00:18:24,084
怯えるこの手の中には 手折られた花の刃
Held within these trembling hands is the blade of a plucked flower.

142
00:18:24,084 --> 00:18:28,584
想いだけが生きる全て
My feelings are all that I live by,

143
00:18:28,584 --> 00:18:32,584
心に振りかざす
brandished within my heart,

144
00:18:32,584 --> 00:18:40,084
願い...
this wish...

145
00:19:33,084 --> 00:19:38,084
囚われた太陽の輝く
When the captive sun shone bright,

146
00:19:42,084 --> 00:19:46,584
不思議の国の本が好きだった頃
back when I loved books of wonderland,

147
00:19:49,084 --> 00:19:52,584
願いはきっと叶うと
that wishes would surely come true,

148
00:19:52,584 --> 00:19:57,384
教えるお伽噺を信じた
I believed in the fairy tales that taught us.

149
00:19:57,584 --> 00:20:00,584
静かに...
Quietly...

150
00:20:11,639 --> 00:20:14,239
静かに咲き乱れていた
It bloomed wildly in the silence,

151
00:20:14,239 --> 00:20:19,339
古の魔法 優しく
the gentle magic of ancient times.

152
00:20:19,339 --> 00:20:23,539
世界を変える力が
Whispering that the power to change the world

153
00:20:23,539 --> 00:20:27,739
その手にあると囁く
lies right there in your hands.

154
00:20:27,739 --> 00:20:31,439
終わらない夢を見よう
Let us dream an unending dream,

155
00:20:31,439 --> 00:20:35,239
君と行く時の中で
within this time I spend with you.

156
00:20:35,239 --> 00:20:39,039
想いだけが生きる全て
These feelings alone are all I live for;

157
00:20:39,039 --> 00:20:42,339
命を作るのは
what gives life its breath

158
00:20:42,339 --> 00:20:46,339
願い
is a wish.

159
00:21:48,339 --> 00:21:53,839
サンドリヨン
[Cendrillon]

160
00:22:00,639 --> 00:22:04,039
朝まで踊る夢だけ見せて
Just show me the dream of dancing until morning,

161
00:22:04,039 --> 00:22:07,339
時計の鐘が解く魔法
before the clock's chime undoes the magic.

162
00:22:07,339 --> 00:22:10,639
曖昧な指 誘う階段
Hesitant fingers beckon toward the staircase,

163
00:22:10,639 --> 00:22:14,639
三段飛ばしに跳ねていく
leaping down three steps at a time.

164
00:22:14,639 --> 00:22:19,139
馬車の中で震えてた
Shivering inside the carriage,

165
00:22:19,139 --> 00:22:23,139
みじめな古着めくり
tossing off those miserable old clothes—

166
00:22:23,139 --> 00:22:27,039
廻れ 夜の舞踏
spin around, dance of the night.

167
00:22:28,339 --> 00:22:31,639
見知らぬ顔 探す
Searching for an unknown face,

168
00:22:31,639 --> 00:22:34,839
囁くあの声が
that whispering voice urges:

169
00:22:34,839 --> 00:22:38,139
握りしめた刃 突き立て
"Thrust the blade you grip so tight,

170
00:22:38,139 --> 00:22:41,639
全てを奪えと
and take everything away."

171
00:22:41,639 --> 00:22:44,539
孤児 集う城
In this castle where orphans gather,

172
00:22:44,539 --> 00:22:47,939
笑み仮面に描いて
painting smiles upon their masks,

173
00:22:47,939 --> 00:22:51,239
偽りの慈しみさえ
even false affection is wrapped

174
00:22:51,239 --> 00:22:54,439
羽で包む
in the wings of

175
00:22:54,439 --> 00:22:57,639
セラフ
a seraph.

176
00:23:07,339 --> 00:23:11,339
灰の中で赤く
Melting and blending

177
00:23:11,339 --> 00:23:16,139
溶けて混じる
into a crimson hue amid the ash:

178
00:23:16,139 --> 00:23:19,839
ガラスの靴
the glass slippers.

179
00:23:20,639 --> 00:23:24,039
今更変える 震えているの
It's too late to turn back, yet I'm trembling,

180
00:23:24,039 --> 00:23:27,239
あなたが目をやる時計
as your eyes glance toward the clock.

181
00:23:27,239 --> 00:23:30,639
靴脱ぎ踊る スロープ抜けて
Kicking off my shoes to dance, escaping down the slope,

182
00:23:30,639 --> 00:23:34,639
喉まで伸びる指の先で
with fingertips reaching up to the throat,

183
00:23:34,639 --> 00:23:39,639
すくう雫 口づけて
kissing away the drops scooped up.

184
00:23:39,639 --> 00:23:44,439
走る衝動 背骨抜けていく
A surging impulse shoots down my spine;

185
00:23:44,439 --> 00:23:47,339
刹那
that fleeting moment.

186
00:23:48,439 --> 00:23:51,839
鐘は鳴らさないで
Don't let the bells toll!

187
00:23:51,839 --> 00:23:54,939
あなたに跪き
Kneeling before you,

188
00:23:54,939 --> 00:23:58,239
「まだダメ」と叫んだ右手が
my right hand cried, "Not yet!"

189
00:23:58,239 --> 00:24:01,639
突き刺す サヨナラ
as it thrusts a parting farewell.

190
00:24:01,639 --> 00:24:04,939
消せない硝煙を
Scented with indelible gunpowder smoke,

191
00:24:04,939 --> 00:24:08,239
香水にまとう姫
a princess veiled in perfume.

192
00:24:08,239 --> 00:24:11,539
強い瞳 僕の凍った
Those fierce eyes pierce straight through

193
00:24:11,539 --> 00:24:16,339
仮面ごと撃ち抜く
my frozen mask.

194
00:24:21,339 --> 00:24:25,839
今も耳に あなたの吐息が
Even now, your breath lingers in my ears,

195
00:24:25,839 --> 00:24:30,039
突き刺さるの
piercing through me;

196
00:24:30,039 --> 00:24:34,239
遠い夢
a distant dream.

197
00:24:34,239 --> 00:24:40,239
ステンドグラス越し 光る月が
Through the stained glass, the shining moon

198
00:24:40,239 --> 00:24:44,639
君にかぶせたベール
casts a veil over you.

199
00:24:47,339 --> 00:24:50,539
ドレス膝で裂いて
Tearing my dress at the knees,

200
00:24:50,539 --> 00:24:53,839
ティアラは投げ捨てて
casting away the tiara,

201
00:24:53,839 --> 00:24:57,239
見つめ合う瞳と瞳が
our gazing eyes lock together

202
00:24:57,239 --> 00:24:59,839
火花を放つ
and spark into flames.

203
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:03,510
ほどくな 魂が
Don't untie it; our souls

204
00:25:03,560 --> 00:25:06,360
炎をあげ 惹かれ合う
ignite and are drawn to one another.

205
00:25:06,460 --> 00:25:09,760
その涙 救えないなら
If I cannot save those tears,

206
00:25:09,860 --> 00:25:13,160
まるで独り遊び
it's just like playing by myself.

207
00:25:13,360 --> 00:25:16,760
時よ止まれ 今は
Time, please stop, for now

208
00:25:16,810 --> 00:25:19,660
あなたに酔いしれて
I'm intoxicated by you,

209
00:25:19,710 --> 00:25:22,960
揺れる鼓動 ひとつひとつを
wanting to etch each and every one

210
00:25:23,010 --> 00:25:26,360
刻みつけてたい
of these trembling heartbeats.

211
00:25:26,460 --> 00:25:29,760
留まれ 熱く濡れ
Stay, drenched in heat,

212
00:25:29,810 --> 00:25:32,860
打ちつける雨足に
under the pounding rain;

213
00:25:32,910 --> 00:25:36,560
これ以上は動けないよ
I can move no further,

214
00:25:36,660 --> 00:25:43,160
まるでフェアリーテイル
just like a fairy tale.

215
00:26:03,960 --> 00:26:06,760
側にいても 離れたまま
Even side by side, we remain apart,

216
00:26:06,760 --> 00:26:09,860
ひとつになれない連星
a binary star unable to become one:

217
00:26:09,910 --> 00:26:12,760
アルビレオ
Albireo.

218
00:26:26,360 --> 00:26:29,460
ああ 君が思うよりも
Ah, more than you think,

219
00:26:29,510 --> 00:26:32,460
僕は君でいっぱいだ
my heart is full of you.

220
00:26:32,510 --> 00:26:35,660
流星みたいな移ろいを
The fleeting changes like a shooting star,

221
00:26:35,710 --> 00:26:39,160
片時も離さず見ていたいの
I want to watch them without looking away for a moment.

222
00:26:39,210 --> 00:26:42,560
ああ 僕が思うよりも
Ah, far more than I realize,

223
00:26:42,610 --> 00:26:46,060
君はずっと ずっと遠い
you are so very, very far away.

224
00:26:46,110 --> 00:26:49,060
重なったように見える仕草
Your gestures that seem to overlap with mine

225
00:26:49,110 --> 00:26:52,660
苦しくなるほどに美しいな
are painfully beautiful.

226
00:26:52,760 --> 00:26:55,960
君が好きって感情が
The feeling that I love you

227
00:26:56,010 --> 00:26:59,360
残らず夜空を飾っている
completely decorates the night sky.

228
00:26:59,410 --> 00:27:02,960
心が余った言い訳を
An excuse for my overflowing heart,

229
00:27:03,010 --> 00:27:06,960
愛だなんて呼びたくない
I don't want to call it love.

230
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:10,560
君は藍に浮かんだアルビレオ
You are Albireo floating in indigo,

231
00:27:10,610 --> 00:27:13,860
この心を奪ったまま
having stolen this heart away.

232
00:27:13,910 --> 00:27:17,360
要らないのなら返してよ
If you don't want it, give it back,

233
00:27:17,410 --> 00:27:20,560
他に置き場もないけどさ
though I have nowhere else to put it anyway.

234
00:27:20,610 --> 00:27:23,860
いまもアイミスユーの切れ端が
Even now, fragments of "I miss you"

235
00:27:23,910 --> 00:27:27,260
成層圏で燃えて
burn in the stratosphere.

236
00:27:27,310 --> 00:27:30,360
側にいても 離れたまま
Even side by side, we remain apart,

237
00:27:30,410 --> 00:27:33,460
ひとつになれない連星
a binary star unable to become one:

238
00:27:33,510 --> 00:27:35,960
アルビレオ
Albireo.

239
00:27:40,960 --> 00:27:44,360
何光年先で輝いてる
Shining so many light-years away,

240
00:27:44,410 --> 00:27:47,560
君に 君に恋をしたんだ
with you, with you I fell in love.

241
00:27:47,610 --> 00:27:50,860
何光年先か測れぬほど
So distant that light-years cannot measure it,

242
00:27:50,910 --> 00:27:57,160
君の光が眩しすぎたから
because your light was just too dazzling.

243
00:27:57,760 --> 00:28:00,960
君が好きって感情で
With the feeling that I love you,

244
00:28:01,010 --> 00:28:04,260
それだけで星が周っている
the stars revolve just on that alone.

245
00:28:04,310 --> 00:28:07,860
明日を生きる言い訳を
An excuse to live tomorrow,

246
00:28:07,910 --> 00:28:11,960
愛だなんて呼んでみたい
I want to try calling it love.

247
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:15,660
君は藍に浮かんだアルビレオ
You are Albireo floating in indigo,

248
00:28:15,710 --> 00:28:18,960
この心を奪ったまま
having stolen this heart away.

249
00:28:19,010 --> 00:28:22,460
要らないのなら返してよ
If you don't want it, give it back,

250
00:28:22,510 --> 00:28:25,560
他に置き場もないけどさ
though I have nowhere else to put it anyway.

251
00:28:25,610 --> 00:28:28,960
いまもアイミスユーの切れ端が
Even now, fragments of "I miss you"

252
00:28:29,010 --> 00:28:32,460
成層圏で燃えて
burn in the stratosphere.

253
00:28:32,510 --> 00:28:35,560
側にいても 離れたまま
Even side by side, we remain apart,

254
00:28:35,610 --> 00:28:38,860
ひとつになれない連星
a binary star unable to become one.

255
00:28:38,910 --> 00:28:42,260
君は愛の色したアルビレオ
You are Albireo colored like love,

256
00:28:42,310 --> 00:28:45,560
この心焦がすほどの
burning this heart of mine so intensely.

257
00:28:45,610 --> 00:28:48,860
誰より近く恋してた
Loving you closer than anyone else,

258
00:28:48,910 --> 00:28:52,560
届くわけもないのにさ
even though it could never reach.

259
00:28:52,610 --> 00:28:55,860
いまも温度を超えた高鳴りが
Even now, a throbbing surpassing temperature

260
00:28:55,910 --> 00:28:59,060
君を好きと叫ぶ
cries out that I love you.

261
00:28:59,110 --> 00:29:02,060
離れてても 消えないまま
Even far apart, never fading away,

262
00:29:02,110 --> 00:29:05,460
ふたつにならない二重星
a binary star unable to separate into two:

263
00:29:05,510 --> 00:29:08,160
アルビレオ
Albireo.

264
00:29:55,560 --> 00:29:58,460
子供の頃
As a child,

265
00:29:58,510 --> 00:30:00,160
見上げた
I looked up

266
00:30:01,801 --> 00:30:03,901
夜の空に
Looking up at the night sky,

267
00:30:04,101 --> 00:30:05,901
想った
I thought to myself...

268
00:30:06,301 --> 00:30:10,001
あのひとつひとつに
Within each and every one of those stars,

269
00:30:10,201 --> 00:30:14,701
誰かの願いがこもってる
someone's wish is held.

270
00:30:18,801 --> 00:30:21,401
そのひとつが
If one of those stars

271
00:30:21,401 --> 00:30:24,001
あなたで
were you,

272
00:30:24,301 --> 00:30:27,301
すぐ隣で
and right beside me,

273
00:30:27,301 --> 00:30:29,101
笑ってて
you were smiling...

274
00:30:29,301 --> 00:30:32,301
ねえ 時を止めれるなら
Hey, if I could stop time,

275
00:30:32,301 --> 00:30:37,501
この一秒を切り取って
I'd cut out and keep this single second.

276
00:30:42,101 --> 00:30:47,301
星降る夜に
On this star-falling night,

277
00:30:47,501 --> 00:30:52,301
ただあなたに会いたい
I just want to see you.

278
00:30:52,501 --> 00:30:55,401
あなたの名前を
Your name...

279
00:30:55,401 --> 00:30:58,301
祈るようにそっと
Gently, as if in prayer,

280
00:30:58,301 --> 00:31:04,001
何度も抱きしめているよ
I keep holding it close again and again.

281
00:31:05,001 --> 00:31:09,501
抱きしめているよ
I'm holding it close.

282
00:31:10,301 --> 00:31:12,501
もう私も
I guess I've also

283
00:31:12,501 --> 00:31:15,001
大人ね
grown up now.

284
00:31:15,801 --> 00:31:18,001
変わったこと
Things that have changed,

285
00:31:18,001 --> 00:31:20,501
変わらないこと
things that haven't...

286
00:31:20,501 --> 00:31:24,501
止まらない時計の針が
The relentless hands of the clock

287
00:31:24,501 --> 00:31:29,001
冷たく胸を刻んだ
coldly carved into my heart.

288
00:31:32,801 --> 00:31:34,901
でもあなたに
Yet after meeting

289
00:31:34,901 --> 00:31:37,301
出会って
you,

290
00:31:37,601 --> 00:31:41,301
日々の眩しさを
and learning how dazzling

291
00:31:41,301 --> 00:31:43,801
知って
each day could be,

292
00:31:43,801 --> 00:31:46,801
まだ少し怖いけど
though I'm still a little scared,

293
00:31:46,801 --> 00:31:51,501
いま踏み出せる気がしてるよ
I feel like I can take a step forward now.

294
00:31:52,801 --> 00:31:57,901
星降る夜に
On this star-falling night,

295
00:31:58,201 --> 00:32:02,801
会いたいが募るばかり
my longing to see you only grows.

296
00:32:03,201 --> 00:32:06,101
あなたの名前を
Your name...

297
00:32:06,101 --> 00:32:08,901
祈るようにそっと
Gently, as if in prayer,

298
00:32:08,901 --> 00:32:14,501
何度も抱きしめているよ
I keep holding it close again and again.

299
00:32:14,901 --> 00:32:20,001
高鳴る鼓動が
My pounding heartbeat

300
00:32:20,401 --> 00:32:25,501
身体を追い越していく
races ahead of my body.

301
00:32:25,901 --> 00:32:28,901
私の名前を
You're the one who made

302
00:32:28,901 --> 00:32:31,801
特別にしてくれたの
my name feel so special.

303
00:32:31,801 --> 00:32:36,801
今はただ抱きしめてたいの
Right now, I just want to hold you close.

304
00:32:38,001 --> 00:32:42,001
いつも想ってるよ
I'm always thinking of you.

305
00:32:43,001 --> 00:32:46,401
かじかんだ手に
In my numb hands,

306
00:32:46,401 --> 00:32:49,501
温もり
lies your warmth...

307
00:32:54,501 --> 00:32:57,201
目を閉じて
Closing my eyes,

308
00:32:57,201 --> 00:33:00,001
その先へ
I head toward what lies ahead.

309
00:33:06,301 --> 00:33:11,501
星降る夜に
On this star-falling night,

310
00:33:12,001 --> 00:33:17,001
ただあなたに会いたい
I just want to see you.

311
00:33:17,001 --> 00:33:20,001
あなたの名前を
Your name...

312
00:33:20,001 --> 00:33:23,001
祈るようにそっと
Gently, as if in prayer,

313
00:33:23,001 --> 00:33:28,001
何度も抱きしめているよ
I keep holding it close again and again.

314
00:33:28,301 --> 00:33:33,501
高鳴る鼓動で
With my pounding heartbeat,

315
00:33:34,001 --> 00:33:38,501
裸足のまま駆けていく
I run barefoot ahead.

316
00:33:39,001 --> 00:33:41,901
私の名前を
You're the one who made

317
00:33:41,901 --> 00:33:45,001
特別にしてくれたの
my name feel so special.

318
00:33:45,501 --> 00:33:50,501
あなたが照らし続けてる
You continue to shine down on me.

319
00:33:52,501 --> 00:33:58,001
星降る夜に
On this star-falling night...

320
00:34:35,501 --> 00:34:38,901
Seid ihr das Essen? Nein, wir sind der Jäger!
Are you the prey? No, we are the hunters!

321
00:34:38,901 --> 00:34:44,001
Feuerroter Pfeil und Bogen
Crimson bow and arrow

322
00:34:50,301 --> 00:34:55,401
踏まれた花の名前も知らずに
Without even knowing the names of the trampled flowers,

323
00:34:55,401 --> 00:35:00,001
地に墜ちた鳥は風を待ち侘びる
the birds fallen to the ground long for the wind.

324
00:35:01,449 --> 00:35:04,049
祈ったところで
Even if we pray...

325
00:35:04,049 --> 00:35:06,249
何も変わらない
nothing will change.

326
00:35:06,249 --> 00:35:09,149
今を変えるのは
What changes the present...

327
00:35:09,149 --> 00:35:11,749
戦う覚悟だ
is the resolve to fight.

328
00:35:11,749 --> 00:35:14,349
屍踏み越えて
Step over the corpses,

329
00:35:14,349 --> 00:35:16,949
進む意志を嗤う豚よ
oh swine who mock our will to advance!

330
00:35:16,949 --> 00:35:18,449
家畜の安寧
The complacency of livestock,

331
00:35:18,449 --> 00:35:19,849
虚偽の繁栄
the false prosperity...

332
00:35:19,849 --> 00:35:22,649
死せる餓狼の「自由」を！
Give us the freedom of the dying hungry wolves!

333
00:35:22,649 --> 00:35:25,249
囚われた屈辱は
The humiliation of being trapped

334
00:35:25,249 --> 00:35:27,949
反撃の嚆矢だ
is the signal for our counterattack!

335
00:35:27,949 --> 00:35:30,449
城壁のその彼方
Beyond the walls,

336
00:35:30,449 --> 00:35:33,249
獲物を屠るイェーガー！
the Hunter slaughters prey!

337
00:35:33,249 --> 00:35:35,749
迸る衝動に
In this surging impulse,

338
00:35:35,749 --> 00:35:38,249
その身を灼きながら
while burning its own body,

339
00:35:38,249 --> 00:35:40,849
黄昏に緋を穿つ
piercing scarlet through the twilight—

340
00:35:40,849 --> 00:35:45,049
紅蓮の弓矢
The Crimson Bow and Arrow!

341
00:36:05,049 --> 00:36:07,449
矢を番え追い駈ける
Drawing the arrow, giving chase,

342
00:36:07,449 --> 00:36:09,949
標的は逃がさない
we won't let the target escape!

343
00:36:09,949 --> 00:36:12,549
矢を放ち追い詰める
Releasing the arrow, cornering it,

344
00:36:12,549 --> 00:36:15,249
決して逃がさない
we will never let it escape!

345
00:36:15,249 --> 00:36:17,849
限界まで引き絞る
Drawing back to the limit,

346
00:36:17,849 --> 00:36:20,449
はち切れそうな弦
the string ready to snap,

347
00:36:20,449 --> 00:36:23,249
標的が息絶えるまで
until the target stops breathing,

348
00:36:23,249 --> 00:36:25,849
何度でも放つ
firing again and again!

349
00:36:25,849 --> 00:36:28,549
獲物を殺すのは
What kills the prey

350
00:36:28,549 --> 00:36:31,249
道具でも技術でもない
is neither weapon nor skill...

351
00:36:31,249 --> 00:36:34,049
研ぎ澄まされた
It is your own sharpened...

352
00:36:34,049 --> 00:36:36,849
お前自身の殺意だ
...intent to kill!

353
00:36:36,849 --> 00:36:39,449
Wir sind der Jäger
We are the hunters,

354
00:36:39,449 --> 00:36:42,049
炎のように熱く！
fiery as blazing flames!

355
00:36:42,049 --> 00:36:44,549
Wir sind der Jäger
We are the hunters,

356
00:36:44,549 --> 00:36:47,249
氷のように冷ややかに！
as cold as ice!

357
00:36:47,249 --> 00:36:49,649
Wir sind der Jäger
We are the hunters,

358
00:36:49,649 --> 00:36:52,449
己を矢に込めて！
pouring ourselves into the arrow!

359
00:36:52,449 --> 00:36:54,949
Wir sind der Jäger
We are the hunters,

360
00:36:54,949 --> 00:36:59,349
全てを貫いて征け！
pierce through everything and charge forward!

361
00:37:30,349 --> 00:37:33,249
Angriff auf die Titanen.
Attack on the Titans.

362
00:37:33,549 --> 00:37:39,049
Der Junge von einst wird bald zum Schwert greifen.
The boy of yesteryear will soon take up the sword.

363
00:37:41,649 --> 00:37:47,249
Wer nur seine Machtlosigkeit beklagt, kann nichts verändern.
Those who only lament their powerlessness can change nothing.

364
00:37:47,449 --> 00:37:52,849
Der Junge von einst wird bald das schwarze Schwert ergreifen.
The boy of yesteryear will soon take up the black sword.

365
00:37:53,049 --> 00:37:57,649
Hass und Zorn sind eine zweischneidige Klinge.
Hatred and anger are a double-edged blade.

366
00:37:57,649 --> 00:38:03,349
Bald, eines Tages, wird er dem Schicksal die Zähne zeigen.
Soon, one day, he will bare his teeth at destiny.

367
00:38:03,649 --> 00:38:09,049
何かを変えることができるのは
Those who are able to change something...

368
00:38:09,049 --> 00:38:14,049
何かを捨てることができるもの
are those who can cast something away!

369
00:38:14,049 --> 00:38:19,349
何一つリスクなど背負わないままで
Without shouldering a single risk,

370
00:38:19,349 --> 00:38:24,249
何かが叶うなど...
to think anything could come true...

371
00:38:24,249 --> 00:38:26,949
暗愚の想定 唯の幻影
Foolish assumptions, mere illusions...

372
00:38:26,949 --> 00:38:29,749
今は無謀な勇気も
Even reckless courage now...

373
00:38:29,749 --> 00:38:32,349
「自由」の尖兵 賭けの攻勢
The vanguard of 'Freedom', an all-or-nothing offensive...

374
00:38:32,349 --> 00:38:34,849
走る奴隷に勝利を！
Victory to the running slaves!

375
00:38:34,849 --> 00:38:37,449
架せられた不条理は
The absurdity forced upon us

376
00:38:37,449 --> 00:38:40,049
進撃の嚆矢だ
is the signal of our onslaught!

377
00:38:40,049 --> 00:38:42,649
奪われたその地平
From that stolen horizon,

378
00:38:42,649 --> 00:38:45,549
『世界』を望む エレン！
Eren longs for that world!

379
00:38:45,549 --> 00:38:48,149
止め処なき衝動に
In this unstoppable impulse,

380
00:38:48,149 --> 00:38:50,649
その身を侵されながら
while letting it consume his very body,

381
00:38:50,649 --> 00:38:53,249
宵闇に紫を運ぶ
carrying violet into the twilight—

382
00:38:53,249 --> 00:38:57,649
冥府の弓矢
The Bow and Arrow of the Underworld!

383
00:39:34,049 --> 00:39:37,049
ということで！スペシャルゲスト！
And with that! Our special guest!

384
00:39:37,049 --> 00:39:40,649
可愛い可愛い町田ちまちゃんに来ていただきました〜！
The super cute Machita Chima-chan has joined us!

385
00:39:40,649 --> 00:39:43,349
こんばんは〜！にじさんじ所属、
Good evening! From NIJISANJI,

386
00:39:43,349 --> 00:39:45,649
上から読んでも下から読んでも町田ちまで〜す！
read it from the top or from the bottom, it's Machita Chima!

387
00:39:45,649 --> 00:39:46,849
ニコちゃんお誕生日おめでとう〜！
Nico-chan, happy birthday!

388
00:39:46,849 --> 00:39:48,849
ありがとう〜！ちまちゃん！
Thank you, Chima-chan!

389
00:39:49,049 --> 00:39:52,649
気づいたらこんなことになってたんだね、ちまちゃん
Before we knew it, this is what happened, Chima-chan!

390
00:39:52,849 --> 00:39:54,849
なんかね、大きくなっちゃってた
Yeah, somehow I grew super big!

391
00:39:54,849 --> 00:39:58,649
大きくなっちゃってるっていうか、すごいサイズになってるんだけど
Rather than just growing big, you've become a colossal size!

392
00:39:58,649 --> 00:40:00,849
なんか後ろから光も差してるし
Plus, there's light shining from behind you!

393
00:40:00,849 --> 00:40:02,449
そう、後光が綺麗でしょ？
Yeah, isn't my halo pretty?

394
00:40:02,449 --> 00:40:04,249
綺麗だね〜似合うよ、ちまちゃん
It's pretty! It suits you, Chima-chan!

395
00:40:04,249 --> 00:40:05,349
ありがと〜
Thank you~

396
00:40:04,804 --> 00:40:08,304
いや今日はね ちまちゃんと『紅蓮の弓矢』を歌わせていただいたんだけど
Today, Chima-chan and I sang "Guren no Yumiya," but...

397
00:40:08,304 --> 00:40:09,004
はい
Yes.

398
00:40:09,004 --> 00:40:11,804
やっぱニコね、ちまちゃんのハイトーンも好きなんだけど、
You know, Nico loves Chima-chan's high tones,

399
00:40:11,804 --> 00:40:12,404
うん
Yeah.

400
00:40:12,404 --> 00:40:14,104
かっこよさも好きなのよ
but I also love how cool you are!

401
00:40:14,104 --> 00:40:15,304
おぉ、ありがとう
Oh, thank you!

402
00:40:15,304 --> 00:40:18,204
なんかそんな2つを交えられたらいいなと思って今回選びました
So I picked the song thinking it'd be great to combine both!

403
00:40:18,304 --> 00:40:21,204
ありがとー！一緒に歌えて嬉しかったー！
Thank you! I was so happy to sing together!

404
00:40:21,204 --> 00:40:22,604
えぇ、良かったー！
Yay, I'm so glad!

405
00:40:22,604 --> 00:40:23,604
ニコちゃーん
Nico-chan...

406
00:40:23,604 --> 00:40:25,604
ニコたんとバトルできて楽しかった？
Was it fun battling with Nicotan?

407
00:40:25,604 --> 00:40:27,804
もう大変だったよ、もうー
Man, it was so tough, seriously!

408
00:40:28,404 --> 00:40:30,604
戦いたかったから嬉しいです
But I really wanted to battle, so I'm happy!

409
00:40:30,604 --> 00:40:32,404
あははは、全然…ｗ
Ahahaha, totally... lol

410
00:40:32,804 --> 00:40:35,404
え、あのゴーレムは何だったの？
By the way, what was that golem?

411
00:40:35,504 --> 00:40:38,604
あれはまちたの眷属のゴーレムです
That was Machita's minion golem.

412
00:40:38,604 --> 00:40:39,704
そうだよね？
I knew it, right?

413
00:40:39,704 --> 00:40:40,104
うん
Yeah.

414
00:40:40,104 --> 00:40:42,504
ありがと、言わせたみたいになってるけどｗ
Thanks, though it feels like I forced you to say that. lol

415
00:40:42,504 --> 00:40:46,604
いやもうすごい強かったよ、町田ちゃんのも、ゴーレムが
No, seriously, it was so strong—Machida-chan, and your golem too!

416
00:40:46,804 --> 00:40:50,404
ねえ、めちゃくちゃ強かったけど、倒されちゃったんだよね、ニコちゃんに
Yeah, it was super strong, but Nico-chan defeated it.

417
00:40:50,404 --> 00:40:52,404
そうだよね、ニコたん強かったからね
That's right, because Nicotan was strong!

418
00:40:52,404 --> 00:40:57,504
うん、ニコちゃんのおかげでなんか町田自身もパワーが…なんかどんどん削がれて、あ…
Yeah, thanks to Nico-chan, even Machita's own power was rapidly draining away... Ah...

419
00:40:57,504 --> 00:40:58,404
ちまちゃん！
Chima-chan!

420
00:40:58,404 --> 00:40:59,804
ああ、もうダメかもしれない…
Ah, I might not make it...

421
00:40:59,804 --> 00:41:00,804
なんだか雲が！
Wait, the clouds!

422
00:41:00,804 --> 00:41:01,604
時間が…ない…
I'm running... out of time...

423
00:41:01,604 --> 00:41:02,404
ちまちゃん！
Chima-chan!

424
00:41:02,404 --> 00:41:05,604
ニコちゃん本当におめでとう！ありがとー！これからもよろしくね！またねー！バイバーイ！
Nico-chan, happy birthday! Thank you! Looking forward to more! See you! Bye-bye!

425
00:41:05,604 --> 00:41:09,004
ちまーーーん！
Chima-chan---!

426
00:41:16,204 --> 00:41:21,604
Party is over

427
00:41:18,304 --> 00:41:23,304
火炎 / 作詞・作曲：薔薇園アヴ
[Song: Kaen / Lyrics & Music: Avu Barazono]

428
00:41:21,604 --> 00:41:26,804
それでも踊りたかった
Still, I wanted to keep dancing

429
00:41:27,204 --> 00:41:32,304
眠れないくらい
So much I couldn't sleep

430
00:41:32,604 --> 00:41:38,504
情熱の火は いつしか いつの日にか
The fire of passion, someday, at some point

431
00:41:38,604 --> 00:41:43,804
身体は気付いている 焔はいつか消える
The body already knows the flame will someday burn out

432
00:41:44,004 --> 00:41:50,604
ねえ 何も要らないはずだった なのにまだ I'm so serious
Hey, I wasn't supposed to need anything, yet I'm still so serious

433
00:41:50,804 --> 00:41:55,604
ああ まだ間に合う
Ah, there's still time

434
00:41:56,004 --> 00:42:00,004
ああ ただ間に合う
Ah, just in time

435
00:42:00,304 --> 00:42:04,404
びいびい泣いたってそんなに甘くないよ
Whining and crying won't make life any sweeter

436
00:42:04,404 --> 00:42:07,604
でもきっとそんなに悪くないよ
But surely it isn't so bad either

437
00:42:07,604 --> 00:42:10,604
ああ Give me fire
Ah, give me fire

438
00:42:10,604 --> 00:42:13,504
Light it up baby 燃やしちゃえよ Yeah
Light it up, baby, burn it all down, yeah

439
00:42:24,804 --> 00:42:30,304
やあああああああ
Yaaaaaaaah

440
00:42:30,304 --> 00:42:34,604
やあああああああ
Yaaaaaaaah

441
00:42:34,804 --> 00:42:39,304
ああああああああ
Aaaaaaaaah

442
00:42:39,804 --> 00:42:45,204
燃えろよ 燃えろよ 炎よ 燃えろ
Burn, burn, blaze away, O flames

443
00:42:45,304 --> 00:42:48,504
八百屋お七 燃えお七 狂いもせずに
Yaoya Oshichi, burning Oshichi, without even going mad

444
00:42:48,504 --> 00:42:51,604
恋となれば 溶かし全部燃やせ八百屋お七
When it comes to love, melt and burn everything, Yaoya Oshichi

445
00:42:51,604 --> 00:42:54,504
生まれ前世が火の中か？ 傷消えぬ名残が火傷
Was my past life born within fire? Scars that never fade leave a burn

446
00:42:54,504 --> 00:42:57,304
ガソリンとフェザー 燃える様お見事
Gasoline and feathers, a magnificent blaze

447
00:42:57,304 --> 00:43:00,204
火遊びはしない（しない） 到底真似できない（無理）
Don't play with fire (won't do it) Impossible to imitate (no way)

448
00:43:00,204 --> 00:43:02,704
仕掛けてカルマドラマ 燃え尽くすマグマドラマ
Setting up a karma drama, burning it down in a magma drama

449
00:43:02,704 --> 00:43:05,404
この飽くなき業火 青い炎見たい
In this insatiable hellfire, I want to see blue flames

450
00:43:05,404 --> 00:43:08,804
私は過去の一つとなり やがて全て一つとなり
I become one with the past, and eventually everything becomes one

451
00:43:08,804 --> 00:43:13,304
Love is dying

452
00:43:13,304 --> 00:43:18,604
でもまだ消えてないから
But because it hasn't died out yet

453
00:43:19,104 --> 00:43:24,204
忘れてみたい
I want to try forgetting

454
00:43:24,304 --> 00:43:30,104
情熱の火は いつしか いつの日にか
The fire of passion, someday, at some point

455
00:43:30,204 --> 00:43:35,604
身体は気付いている 僕らはいつか消える
The body already knows that we will someday disappear

456
00:43:35,604 --> 00:43:41,504
ゆるやかに若さを溶かして 泣かないで Why so serious?
Gently melting away youth, don't cry, why so serious?

457
00:43:41,804 --> 00:43:46,804
ああ まだ間に合う
Ah, there's still time

458
00:43:47,304 --> 00:43:51,504
ああ ただ間に合う
Ah, just in time

459
00:43:51,604 --> 00:43:55,604
びいびい泣いたってそんなに甘くないよ
Whining and crying won't make life any sweeter

460
00:43:55,604 --> 00:43:58,704
でもきっとそんなに悪くないよ
But surely it isn't so bad either

461
00:43:58,704 --> 00:44:01,604
ああ Give me fire
Ah, give me fire

462
00:44:01,604 --> 00:44:04,804
Light it up baby 燃やしちゃえよ Yeah
Light it up, baby, burn it all down, yeah

463
00:44:15,804 --> 00:44:21,604
やあああああああ
Yaaaaaaaah

464
00:44:21,804 --> 00:44:23,304
やああああ
Yaaaaah

465
00:44:23,304 --> 00:44:26,004
Fire Fire 足りない 注ぐ火に油
Fire, fire, not enough, pouring fuel on the flames

466
00:44:26,004 --> 00:44:28,804
Sorry darling hurry up ああ まだ間に合う
Sorry darling, hurry up, ah, there's still time

467
00:44:28,804 --> 00:44:31,604
Sorry darling hurry up ああ ただ間に合う
Sorry darling, hurry up, ah, just in time

468
00:44:31,604 --> 00:44:34,604
Give me fire

469
00:44:34,604 --> 00:44:37,604
Light it up baby 燃やしちゃえよ Yeah
Light it up, baby, burn it all down, yeah

470
00:44:37,804 --> 00:44:42,504
Party is over

471
00:44:42,504 --> 00:44:47,804
それでも踊りたかった
Still, I wanted to keep dancing

472
00:45:04,385 --> 00:45:08,985
魂の色は何色ですか
What color is your soul?

473
00:45:21,285 --> 00:45:24,385
もういっそ 折れたままで
"I'd rather stay broken,"

474
00:45:24,585 --> 00:45:27,685
捨てるほど 逃げ出すほど
But I'm not strong enough to throw it away

475
00:45:27,685 --> 00:45:30,785
強くないよ ほら
or run away—look,

476
00:45:30,985 --> 00:45:33,985
もう一度 鼓動、高鳴る
once again, my heartbeat races.

477
00:45:34,185 --> 00:45:37,085
何が正しいかなんて
What is right?

478
00:45:37,185 --> 00:45:40,085
わからないけど
I don't really know, but...

479
00:45:40,785 --> 00:45:45,585
形のないものばかりが
all the things that have no form

480
00:45:45,785 --> 00:45:49,485
大切になって行く
become so precious to me.

481
00:45:49,785 --> 00:45:55,485
飾らない言葉だけが
Only unadorned words

482
00:45:55,685 --> 00:46:00,485
強く結ばれてる
are tied strongly together.

483
00:46:00,885 --> 00:46:05,985
また躓いて転がって それでも砕けない
Stumbling and rolling again, yet still not breaking—

484
00:46:06,085 --> 00:46:10,785
魂の色は何色ですか
What color is your soul?

485
00:46:10,985 --> 00:46:16,085
ただ傷ついて強がって それでも見つけたいよ
Just getting hurt and bluffing, yet I still want to find it,

486
00:46:16,285 --> 00:46:20,785
魂のカタチ 確かめてるよ
I'm checking the shape of my soul.

487
00:46:32,185 --> 00:46:35,285
深い地の底で一人
Alone at the bottom of the deep earth,

488
00:46:35,285 --> 00:46:38,485
扉と鍵を探す
I search for the door and the key.

489
00:46:38,685 --> 00:46:41,785
お伽話は ほら
The fairy tales, see,

490
00:46:41,885 --> 00:46:45,185
泡の様に全部消えて
vanish completely like bubbles,

491
00:46:45,285 --> 00:46:48,585
葛藤、残像だけ
leaving only conflicts and afterimages

492
00:46:48,685 --> 00:46:51,785
次の頁へ
toward the next page.

493
00:46:52,085 --> 00:46:56,785
伸びてく枝葉が分かれて
The growing branches part ways,

494
00:46:56,885 --> 00:47:00,785
それぞれの道を行く
each heading down their own path.

495
00:47:00,985 --> 00:47:06,285
寂しい思い出だけが
Only lonely memories

496
00:47:06,485 --> 00:47:10,885
強く根を張ってる
take deep root.

497
00:47:13,985 --> 00:47:19,085
まだ貫いて失って それでも挫けない
Still piercing through, losing along the way, yet never yielding—

498
00:47:19,185 --> 00:47:24,285
心はどこに 器はどこに
Where is the heart? Where is the vessel?

499
00:47:24,385 --> 00:47:29,285
ただ残されて抜け落ちて それでも伝えたいよ
Left behind, shedding away, yet I still want to convey

500
00:47:29,385 --> 00:47:34,085
魂の日々を 魂の意志を
the days of the soul, the will of the soul.

501
00:47:34,185 --> 00:47:36,285
ずっと
Always...

502
00:48:06,785 --> 00:48:10,785
魂の色は
What color is

503
00:48:10,985 --> 00:48:15,785
何色ですか
your soul?

504
00:48:16,085 --> 00:48:20,785
赤い色ですか
Is it red?

505
00:48:20,985 --> 00:48:25,785
青い色ですか
Is it blue?

506
00:48:26,585 --> 00:48:31,085
魂の色は
What color is

507
00:48:31,185 --> 00:48:36,085
何色ですか
your soul?

508
00:48:36,285 --> 00:48:41,085
透明な過去に 不透明な明日に
In a transparent past, in an opaque tomorrow,

509
00:48:41,185 --> 00:48:46,185
生きるあなたは何色ですか
living your life, what color are you?

510
00:48:46,585 --> 00:48:51,885
また躓いて転がって それでも砕けない
Stumbling and rolling again, yet still not breaking—

511
00:48:51,985 --> 00:48:56,785
魂の色は何色ですか
What color is your soul?

512
00:48:56,985 --> 00:49:02,085
ただ傷ついて強がって それでも見つけたいよ
Just getting hurt and bluffing, yet I still want to find it,

513
00:49:02,185 --> 00:49:06,885
魂のカタチ 確かめてるよ
I'm checking the shape of my soul.

514
00:49:06,985 --> 00:49:09,785
ずっと
Always...

515
00:49:40,785 --> 00:49:45,385
その胸にしまった火に憧れた
I yearned for the fire tucked away in your chest,

516
00:49:45,485 --> 00:49:50,085
飲み込まれて消されてしまいそうで
as if it would swallow me up and wipe me away.

517
00:49:50,185 --> 00:49:54,185
夕焼けみたいに暖かくて
Warm like the evening glow,

518
00:49:54,235 --> 00:49:58,285
寂しくて強かったその火に
lonely yet strong—to that fire,

519
00:49:58,435 --> 00:50:02,285
言葉選んで 挙げ句間違えた
I chose my words, and ended up getting them wrong.

520
00:50:03,500 --> 00:50:07,400
よく晴れた日を 未だに思い出す
I still remember that bright and sunny day.

521
00:50:07,600 --> 00:50:11,700
目を伏せたら もう 動けなくて
Once I cast my eyes down, I couldn't move anymore,

522
00:50:11,900 --> 00:50:16,500
嫌われていないこと 祈るばかり
just praying that I wasn't hated.

523
00:50:16,800 --> 00:50:20,900
心全部 見せてくれた
You showed me all of your heart,

524
00:50:21,100 --> 00:50:25,800
何一つ 出来なかったのに
even though I couldn't do a single thing for you.

525
00:50:26,100 --> 00:50:30,100
どんな今を 生きていますか
What kind of present are you living right now?

526
00:50:30,300 --> 00:50:34,800
好きだった歌は まだ 聴こえますか
Can you still hear the songs you loved?

527
00:50:34,900 --> 00:50:39,300
くしゃみひとつで 笑った泣き顔を
A single sneeze turned your tearful face to a smile;

528
00:50:39,400 --> 00:50:44,400
離れても 傍に居る 気で居るよ
even if we're apart, I'll feel like I'm by your side.

529
00:50:52,300 --> 00:50:56,300
口先だけで 繋いだ 知らないで
Tied together by mere lip service, without realizing it,

530
00:50:56,400 --> 00:51:00,500
それでも離さない 一人は怖い
yet I won't let go; I'm afraid of being alone.

531
00:51:00,700 --> 00:51:05,200
疲れた息を吐いて いろんな事が
Letting out a tired breath, so many things

532
00:51:05,400 --> 00:51:09,900
奇跡みたいに思えて どうしようもない
feel like miracles, and I can't help it.

533
00:51:10,100 --> 00:51:14,300
少しずつ 感じなくなっていく
Little by little, I stop feeling them;

534
00:51:14,400 --> 00:51:18,700
悔しかった帰り道 忘れていく
I begin to forget the bitter journey home.

535
00:51:18,900 --> 00:51:23,200
そうしなきゃダメな 時がくる
The time comes when I have no choice,

536
00:51:23,400 --> 00:51:27,700
それでもそう出来ない こともある
yet there are times when I still can't do it.

537
00:51:28,000 --> 00:51:32,200
黙ったままの 指切り
A pinky promise made in silence,

538
00:51:32,300 --> 00:51:36,800
何が解らないか 解らないまゝ
without even knowing what I don't understand.

539
00:51:36,900 --> 00:51:41,100
星を読んで 位置を知るように
Just like reading the stars to find one's place,

540
00:51:41,300 --> 00:51:45,700
君の声で 僕は進めるんだ
guided by your voice, I can move forward.

541
00:51:45,900 --> 00:51:50,200
さよならを 言った場所から
Even far from the place where we said goodbye,

542
00:51:50,300 --> 00:51:56,400
離れても 聴こえるよ 約束が
I can still hear it—our promise.

543
00:52:21,000 --> 00:52:25,400
その胸にしまった灯に 憧れた
I longed for the light you kept hidden in your chest;

544
00:52:25,600 --> 00:52:29,900
こんな思い 気付かなかったでしょう
you probably never realized these feelings.

545
00:52:30,100 --> 00:52:34,600
その灯が その目に 見えなくても
Even if that light is invisible to those eyes,

546
00:52:34,700 --> 00:52:39,000
この瞼の裏に 宿る 残る
it dwells and remains behind these eyelids.

547
00:52:39,200 --> 00:52:43,300
さよならを 言った場所には
In the place where we said goodbye,

548
00:52:43,500 --> 00:52:47,900
君の声が ずっと輝くんだ
your voice will shine forever.

549
00:52:48,100 --> 00:52:52,200
君が君を 見失っても
Even if you lose sight of who you are,

550
00:52:52,400 --> 00:52:56,800
僕が見つけ出せるよ 君の声が
I'll be able to find you—your voice...

551
00:52:57,300 --> 00:53:01,400
どんな今を 生きていますか
What kind of present are you living right now?

552
00:53:01,600 --> 00:53:05,900
僕の歌が 今 聴こえますか
Can you hear my song right now?

553
00:53:06,100 --> 00:53:10,400
くしゃみひとつで 取り戻せるよ
With just a single sneeze, I can bring it back;

554
00:53:10,500 --> 00:53:18,400
離れても 傍に居る 気で居るよ
even if we're apart, I'll feel like I'm by your side.

555
00:53:52,200 --> 00:53:56,900
ということで、「サザンクロス」を歌わせていただきました！
And with that, I had the pleasure of singing "Southern Cross"!

556
00:53:57,300 --> 00:54:01,700
ちびにこたん、一緒に歌ってくれてありがとう。出ておいでー。
Chibi Nicotan, thank you for singing with me. Come on out!

557
00:54:01,900 --> 00:54:06,500
うわー！ありがとーい！にこたんだー！
Whoa! Thank you! It's Nicotan!

558
00:54:06,700 --> 00:54:08,200
にこたんだよ〜
It's Nicotan~

559
00:54:08,300 --> 00:54:10,600
ちびにこたん、ようやく会えたね。
Chibi Nicotan, we finally get to meet.

560
00:54:10,700 --> 00:54:15,400
え、てか、本当にちっちゃいんだねー。かわいい！
Wait, like, you're really so tiny. So cute!

561
00:54:15,500 --> 00:54:17,200
えへ、ありがとー。
Ehehe, thank you.

562
00:54:17,300 --> 00:54:19,300
え、本当にかわいい、かわいい、てか...
Ah, seriously so cute, cute, like...

563
00:54:19,300 --> 00:54:21,700
もう目の中に入れても痛くないどころか、自分だからね、てかもう...
You're beyond the apple of my eye, since you're me, like...

564
00:54:21,700 --> 00:54:23,900
もう部屋の棚に入れたいね。
I just want to put you on my room's shelf.

565
00:54:23,900 --> 00:54:25,200
食べちゃいたい！
I wanna eat you up!

566
00:54:25,200 --> 00:54:26,900
え、ちょっと何言っ...
Uh, wait, what are you say—

567
00:54:26,900 --> 00:54:29,400
よしよし、かわいい、かわいい...
There there, so cute, so cute...

568
00:54:29,500 --> 00:54:33,700
え、ちょっと... ちびにこたん可愛いけど、さっきからにこちゃん怖いんだけど...
Uh, wait... Chibi Nicotan is cute, but Nico-chan, you've been creeping me out for a bit now...

569
00:54:33,800 --> 00:54:35,300
ごめんごめん！
Sorry, sorry!

570
00:54:35,400 --> 00:54:39,900
ね、にこたん、この後大切なお知らせたくさんしなきゃいけないから、ちょっと待っててくれるかな？
Hey, Nicotan, I have a lot of important announcements to make after this, so could you wait for a bit?

571
00:54:39,900 --> 00:54:42,500
この後のメン限でじっくり愛でるね。
I'll shower you with love during the members-only stream after this.

572
00:54:42,500 --> 00:54:44,200
うん、わかった。
Yeah, got it.

573
00:54:44,300 --> 00:54:47,600
え、とりあえず、にこちゃん、この後もがんばってね！ばいばーい！
Well, anyway, Nico-chan, do your best with the rest of the stream! Bye-bye!

574
00:54:47,700 --> 00:54:50,200
リスナーさんもバイバーイ！
Bye-bye to the listeners too!

575
00:54:50,300 --> 00:54:54,400
はーい、バイバーイ、ちびにこたん。あ〜かわいい〜
Yes, bye-bye, Chibi Nicotan. Ah, so cute~

576
00:54:57,000 --> 00:54:59,456
はぁい、ということで、ちびにこたんに来ていただきましたー。
Okay, and with that, we had Chibi Nicotan join us!

577
00:55:00,255 --> 00:55:01,605
可愛かったねー
That was so cute!

578
00:55:01,655 --> 00:55:04,205
配信はまだまだ続くのですが
The stream is still going to continue,

579
00:55:04,205 --> 00:55:05,955
ここで告知いっちょっか！
but let's do some announcements here!

580
00:55:05,955 --> 00:55:07,355
いくつかございます
There are a few.

581
00:55:07,355 --> 00:55:09,055
まずは、こちら！
First off is this!

582
00:55:12,055 --> 00:55:17,055
虎金妃ニコ誕生日記念2026のグッズが出まーす！やったー！
Kogane Nicon Birthday Celebration 2026 merchandise is coming out! Yay!

583
00:55:17,105 --> 00:55:20,255
早速ね、1つずつグッズを紹介させてください
Right away, let me introduce each item one by one.

584
00:55:20,255 --> 00:55:22,055
1つ目は、こちら！
The first one is this!

585
00:55:22,155 --> 00:55:25,255
清楚ニコたんアクリルジオラマスタンド
Pure & Elegant Nicotan Acrylic Diorama Stand.

586
00:55:25,255 --> 00:55:28,255
イラストは本田ロアロ先生に描いていただきました
The illustration was drawn by Honda Roaro-sensei!

587
00:55:28,255 --> 00:55:30,755
今回の生誕のテーマをもとに、
Based on the theme of this birthday celebration,

588
00:55:30,755 --> 00:55:34,255
ディーヴァ清楚なニコたんをイメージして描いていただいてます！
it was drawn with the image of a diva, pure & elegant Nicotan!

589
00:55:34,255 --> 00:55:38,855
清楚なニコたんをね、ぜひアクリルジオラマスタンドとしておうちに迎えてください！
Please be sure to welcome this pure & elegant Nicotan into your home as an acrylic diorama stand!

590
00:55:39,055 --> 00:55:41,055
お次はこちら！
Next up is this!

591
00:55:41,155 --> 00:55:43,955
ちびニコたんランダム缶バッジ
Chibi Nicotan Random Button Badges!

592
00:55:43,955 --> 00:55:46,355
今回もグッズ化してしまいました！
They've been made into merch this time too!

593
00:55:46,355 --> 00:55:49,855
いろんな表情やポーズのちびニコたんが全部で4種類
There are 4 different Chibi Nicotans with various expressions and poses,

594
00:55:49,855 --> 00:55:52,255
ランダムで1種類だけ入ってます
and 1 random type is included.

595
00:55:52,255 --> 00:55:55,655
どのちびニコたんが出てくるかは開けてからのお楽しみ
Which Chibi Nicotan you'll get is a surprise until you open it!

596
00:55:55,655 --> 00:55:57,255
続いてはこちら！
Next up is this!

597
00:55:57,255 --> 00:56:00,855
ちびニコたんを0距離で？！ぬいぐるみショルダーバッグ
Chibi Nicotan at zero distance?! Plushie Shoulder Bag!

598
00:56:00,855 --> 00:56:04,455
いつでもどこでもちびニコたんと一緒にお出かけできます
You can go out with Chibi Nicotan anytime, anywhere.

599
00:56:04,455 --> 00:56:07,355
いろんなところに連れてってあげてください
Please take her along with you to all kinds of places.

600
00:56:07,355 --> 00:56:09,555
あの頭を開けてね、物入れられます
You can open the head and put things inside.

601
00:56:09,555 --> 00:56:10,955
最後はこちら！
Lastly, this!

602
00:56:10,955 --> 00:56:14,255
獲物を見つけたニコたんぬいぐるみキーホルダー
Nicotan Who Found Her Prey Plush Keychain!

603
00:56:14,255 --> 00:56:16,255
単体で持っていくもよし
Taking it alone is great,

604
00:56:16,255 --> 00:56:18,755
さっきのショルダーバッグにつけていくのもよし
attaching it to the earlier shoulder bag is also great!

605
00:56:18,755 --> 00:56:22,455
いろんなところにつけてニコたん推しをアピールできます
You can attach it anywhere to show off your love for Nicotan!

606
00:56:22,455 --> 00:56:25,255
改めてフルセットはこちら！
Once again, here is the Full Set!

607
00:56:25,255 --> 00:56:27,455
可愛いし美しい！
Cute and beautiful!

608
00:56:27,455 --> 00:56:30,055
ちびニコたんを今回もね、グッズにできて
I'm so glad we could make Chibi Nicotan merch again,

609
00:56:30,055 --> 00:56:33,255
清楚なニコたんもグッズにできて本当に嬉しいです
and make pure & elegant Nicotan merch too, I'm really happy!

610
00:56:33,255 --> 00:56:36,455
使いやすいものも多いのでね、ぜひゲットしてください！
There are many easy-to-use items, so please be sure to get them!

611
00:56:36,455 --> 00:56:39,355
さらに、フルセット購入特典もございます！
Furthermore, there is a Full Set Purchase Bonus!

612
00:56:39,355 --> 00:56:40,655
こちら！
This!

613
00:56:40,655 --> 00:56:43,955
フルセット購入特典、直筆サイン＆
Full Set Purchase Bonus: Hand-signed signature &

614
00:56:43,955 --> 00:56:48,755
箔押し複製メッセージ入りチケット風カード。ライブのチケットみたいになってます、今回の。
Foil-stamped duplicate message ticket-style card. It looks like a live concert ticket this time!

615
00:56:48,755 --> 00:56:52,755
これと、特典のASMRボイスが出ます！
Along with this, a bonus ASMR voice is included!

616
00:56:52,755 --> 00:56:57,855
タイトルは、「野性に戻ってしまった成人女性（虎）」です
The title is: "An adult woman who returned to the wild (tiger)".

617
00:56:57,855 --> 00:57:00,555
どういうことー？！
What does that even mean?!

618
00:57:00,555 --> 00:57:04,455
ちょっと！最後に（虎）ってことは、まあ虎なんだよな？
Wait a minute! Having "(tiger)" at the end means... well, it's a tiger, right?

619
00:57:04,455 --> 00:57:07,655
そういうことでいいよな？グッズさんよぉ？
That's what it means, right, merch team?

620
00:57:07,655 --> 00:57:13,055
ね、チケット風カードにはね、あの心を込めて全てに手書きでサインをさせていただきます
On the ticket-style cards, I will put my heart into hand-signing each and every one.

621
00:57:13,055 --> 00:57:16,655
ボイスは虎として野性に戻ってしまったニコたんを
In the voice drama, to take back Nicotan who returned to the wild as a tiger,

622
00:57:16,655 --> 00:57:20,755
取り戻しに行くリスナーというテーマで収録です
the theme is the listener going to retrieve her.

623
00:57:20,755 --> 00:57:22,955
どういうことなんだろう、本当に...
What is that even about, seriously...

624
00:57:22,955 --> 00:57:25,355
まあでも、ちょっと気になりますよね？
Well, but you're a bit curious, aren't you?

625
00:57:25,355 --> 00:57:28,755
ね、ぜひ聞いてみてください！ちなみに過去一恥ずかしそうな内容です
Please give it a listen! By the way, it's probably my most embarrassing content yet.

626
00:57:28,755 --> 00:57:32,255
グッズは配信後カートオープンです
The merch cart will open after the stream.

627
00:57:32,255 --> 00:57:36,255
フルセットは数量限定ではございません、なのでゆっくり購入してください
The full set is not limited in quantity, so please take your time to purchase.

628
00:57:36,255 --> 00:57:38,955
大事な告知はまだあります
There's still an important announcement,

629
00:57:38,955 --> 00:57:43,455
が、その前に一曲歌わせていただこうかなと思います
but before that, I'd like to sing a song!

630
00:57:43,455 --> 00:57:45,855
ちょっとマイクも変えますね
I'll change my mic for a bit, okay?

631
00:57:50,255 --> 00:57:51,555
次の曲は、
The next song...

632
00:57:51,555 --> 00:57:57,455
ニコたんのことを推して、応援してくれてる皆さんにとっても、とても思い出深いあの曲となっております
...is a very memorable song for everyone who has been supporting and rooting for Nicotan.

633
00:57:57,455 --> 00:58:00,455
歌ってみたも出させていただいてる曲なんですけど
It's a song I also released a cover of, but...

634
00:58:00,455 --> 00:58:03,455
みんな覚えてるかな？
...I wonder if everyone remembers?

635
00:58:03,455 --> 00:58:05,555
それでは聴いてください
Now then, please listen.

636
00:58:05,555 --> 00:58:07,355
「ヒカリへ」
"Hikari e."

637
00:58:28,755 --> 00:58:32,355
What you want?

638
00:58:32,355 --> 00:58:35,955
What you need?

639
00:58:35,955 --> 00:58:39,455
What you want?

640
00:58:39,455 --> 00:58:43,055
What you need and what you want?

641
00:58:43,055 --> 00:58:49,755
理想 現実はクリック 光の速度に変わっても
Reality clicks into my ideals, even if it shifts to the speed of light,

642
00:58:49,755 --> 00:58:53,855
地球の裏より遠い距離
a distance further than the other side of the Earth...

643
00:58:53,855 --> 00:58:57,555
アダムとイブにはなれない
we can never become Adam and Eve.

644
00:58:57,555 --> 00:59:04,055
かなしみの生まれた場所たどって
Tracing back to where sorrow was born,

645
00:59:04,055 --> 00:59:12,555
その傷 優しく触れて癒せたなら
if only I could gently touch and heal those wounds.

646
00:59:12,555 --> 00:59:21,755
溢れる思い 愛は君を照らす光になれる
These overflowing feelings, this love can become a light that shines upon you,

647
00:59:21,755 --> 00:59:27,455
切ないほどに
painfully so.

648
00:59:27,455 --> 00:59:35,855
たとえば未来 そこにあたしがいないと知っても
Even if I knew that I wouldn't be there in that future,

649
00:59:35,855 --> 00:59:41,755
今はそっと抱きしめてあげる
for now, I'll gently hold you close.

650
00:59:41,755 --> 00:59:48,955
運命だって引き寄せて 輝き続けたいよ
I want to draw destiny near and keep on shining,

651
00:59:48,955 --> 00:59:57,255
奇跡だって起こせるって信じたい
I want to believe that I can even make miracles happen.

652
01:00:00,496 --> 01:00:04,796
信じたい
I want to believe...

653
01:00:08,696 --> 01:00:15,296
遠慮がちな言葉の最後 感情記号化されても
Even if words end with hesitation, and emotions are turned into symbols,

654
01:00:15,296 --> 01:00:19,296
心の奥まで伝わらない
they don't reach deep into my heart.

655
01:00:19,296 --> 01:00:22,796
本当の声を聞かせて
Let me hear your true voice.

656
01:00:23,296 --> 01:00:30,096
すべてのことに終わりがあるなら
If everything has an end,

657
01:00:30,096 --> 01:00:37,796
苦しみさえいつか消えるはずだから
then even this pain should fade away someday, so...

658
01:00:38,496 --> 01:00:41,496
溢れる想い
Overflowing feelings,

659
01:00:41,496 --> 01:00:45,596
愛は胸を焦がす
love scorches my heart,

660
01:00:45,596 --> 01:00:52,796
痛みに変わる 愛しい炎に
turning into pain, into a precious flame.

661
01:00:53,296 --> 01:01:00,796
たとえ世界中の声が 拒絶に染め上げられたとしても
Even if the voices of the whole world become tainted with rejection,

662
01:01:00,796 --> 01:01:07,796
私が全部受け止めてあげる
I will embrace it all for you.

663
01:01:08,296 --> 01:01:14,296
人は哀しみを知るために生まれてきたの？
Were humans born just to learn sorrow?

664
01:01:14,296 --> 01:01:22,796
そんなことない もっと愛を知りたい
That's not true—I want to know more love.

665
01:01:23,296 --> 01:01:30,096
孤独が温もりを知るためにあるのなら
If loneliness exists just so we can learn warmth,

666
01:01:30,096 --> 01:01:36,796
幸せはいつだってそこにあるのに
then happiness was always right there, yet...

667
01:01:36,796 --> 01:01:42,296
Ah...

668
01:02:07,496 --> 01:02:11,096
溢れる想い
Overflowing feelings,

669
01:02:11,096 --> 01:02:17,096
愛は君を照らす光になれ
may love become the light that shines upon you,

670
01:02:17,096 --> 01:02:20,796
切ないほどに
so painfully,

671
01:02:20,796 --> 01:02:22,496
信じるため
just so I can believe.

672
01:02:22,496 --> 01:02:31,096
たとえ形のない未来 そこに私がいないとしても
Even if, in an intangible future, I'm no longer there,

673
01:02:31,096 --> 01:02:36,096
今はそっと抱きしめてあげる
right now, I'll gently hold you close.

674
01:02:36,096 --> 01:02:44,096
巡り会って 引き寄せて 輝き続けたいよ
Crossing paths, drawing closer, I want to keep shining!

675
01:02:44,096 --> 01:02:53,296
奇跡だって誇れるって信じた…い
I want to believe we can be proud of this miracle...

676
01:02:54,296 --> 01:03:00,296
信じた…い
I want to believe...

677
01:03:10,796 --> 01:03:15,796
ということで、なんとmiwaさんに来ていただきましたー！
And so, we have the one and only miwa-san here with us!

678
01:03:15,796 --> 01:03:18,296
miwaさーん！
miwa-sa~n!

679
01:03:18,296 --> 01:03:20,796
ハイタッチ！
High five!

680
01:03:20,796 --> 01:03:22,796
あははは！
Ahaha!

681
01:03:22,796 --> 01:03:24,296
miwaさんだ！
It's miwa-san!

682
01:03:24,296 --> 01:03:26,796
こうだ！届いてる！
Like this! It's reaching!

683
01:03:26,796 --> 01:03:29,296
触ってる！すごーい！
We're touching! Amazing!

684
01:03:29,296 --> 01:03:31,796
miwaさんに来ていただき… 届いたー！
Having miwa-san come here... It reached!

685
01:03:31,796 --> 01:03:33,496
miwaです！
I'm miwa!

686
01:03:33,496 --> 01:03:35,296
miwaさん！
miwa-san!

687
01:03:35,296 --> 01:03:39,296
あの、ニコさん、お誕生日おめでとうございます！
Um, Nico-san, happy birthday!

688
01:03:39,296 --> 01:03:42,796
ありがとうございます！めっちゃ嬉しいです！
Thank you so much! I'm so happy!

689
01:03:42,796 --> 01:03:49,096
実はmiwaさんとは、デビュー当時の歌ってみた『ヒカリへ』を作らせていただきまして、
Actually, with miwa-san, around the time of my debut I made a cover of "Hikari e,"

690
01:03:49,096 --> 01:03:56,496
その時からのご縁で、まさかこうして一緒に歌えることが叶うなんて、本当に夢のようでございます、miwaさん！
and from that connection, to think it would come true for us to sing together like this is truly like a dream, miwa-san!

691
01:03:56,496 --> 01:04:00,796
こちらこそです！とっても嬉しいです！美しかった！
The pleasure is mine! I'm so happy too! That was beautiful!

692
01:04:01,096 --> 01:04:05,796
そして！ここでなんと重大な告知2つ目が、ございます！
And now! Right here, we have a major second announcement!

693
01:04:05,796 --> 01:04:13,096
なんと、miwaさんに作詞作曲をしていただいた、ニコたん初めてのオリ曲が出まーす！
miwa-san has written and composed Nico-tan's very first original song, and it's coming out!

694
01:04:13,096 --> 01:04:15,796
イエーイ！やったー！
Yay! Woohoo!

695
01:04:15,796 --> 01:04:19,296
miwaさん、そのタイトルをぜひ発表していただいてもいいでしょうか？
miwa-san, could you please do the honors of announcing the title?

696
01:04:19,296 --> 01:04:21,296
私でいいんでしょうか？
Is it really okay for me to do it?

697
01:04:21,296 --> 01:04:23,796
当たり前じゃないですかー！
Of course it is!

698
01:04:23,796 --> 01:04:26,796
それでは発表させていただきます。
Well then, allow me to announce it.

699
01:04:26,796 --> 01:04:27,796
お願いします！
Please do!

700
01:04:27,796 --> 01:04:30,296
タイトルは…『星炎』です！
The title is... "Seien"!

701
01:04:30,296 --> 01:04:35,296
『星炎』です！「星」に「炎」と書いて『星炎』です！
"Seien"! Written with the characters for "star" and "flame," "Seien"!

702
01:04:35,296 --> 01:04:40,296
実は今回のライブのタイトルにもなってます！『星炎 -Fiastola Diva-』！
It's actually the title of this live show too! "Seien -Fiastola Diva-"!

703
01:04:40,296 --> 01:04:44,496
今回のセットリストも星と炎の曲で作られていて、
Today's setlist was also made up of songs themed around stars and flames,

704
01:04:44,496 --> 01:04:49,496
今回最後に、これからmiwaさんに作っていただいた『星炎』を歌わせていただきます！
and for the grand finale today, I'll now be singing "Seien," which miwa-san wrote for me!

705
01:04:49,796 --> 01:04:56,096
ニコたんがこうしてホロライブに来て、こうやってmiwaさんと出会ったり、嬉しいこともたくさんありながらも、
Nico-tan came to Hololive and got to meet miwa-san like this, and while there were so many happy things,

706
01:04:56,096 --> 01:05:01,796
やっぱり活動で悩んだことだったり、辛いこととか、葛藤とかそういうものがいっぱいあったんですけど…
there were naturally also worries, painful moments, and internal struggles in my activities, but...

707
01:05:02,584 --> 01:05:05,384
それを全部miwaさんに聞いてもらって
She listened to all of that,

708
01:05:05,384 --> 01:05:08,884
あの 歌詞をね 作っていただきました 曲も作っていただきました
and wrote the lyrics and composed the music for me.

709
01:05:08,884 --> 01:05:11,484
本当にmiwaさん ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much, miwa-san!

710
01:05:11,484 --> 01:05:15,084
ありがとうございます！もう本当に光栄です
Thank you! It's truly an honor.

711
01:05:15,084 --> 01:05:21,084
ね、ニコさんの曲 一緒に書けて 本当に光栄ですし 今日 一緒に「ヒカリへ」を歌えて 本当に嬉しかったです
Writing a song with you was such an honor, and I was so happy to sing "Hikari e" together today!

712
01:05:21,084 --> 01:05:23,284
本当にありがとうございます！
Thank you so very much!

713
01:05:23,284 --> 01:05:27,284
では この後 歌う新曲「星炎」楽しみにしてるね
Well then, I'm really looking forward to your new song "Seien" coming up next!

714
01:05:27,284 --> 01:05:29,584
私も みんなと一緒に ここで見てるよー！
I'll be watching right here together with everyone!

715
01:05:29,584 --> 01:05:31,984
ここにいるの？
You're staying right here?

716
01:05:31,984 --> 01:05:34,984
皆さん これからもよろしくお願いします！
Everyone, thank you for your continued support!

717
01:05:34,984 --> 01:05:36,284
よろしくお願いします！
Please keep supporting her!

718
01:05:36,284 --> 01:05:37,884
ありがとうございましたー！
Thank you so much!

719
01:05:37,884 --> 01:05:39,584
ありがとうございましたー！
Thank you so much!

720
01:05:39,584 --> 01:05:40,784
バイバーイ！
Bye-bye!

721
01:05:40,784 --> 01:05:41,984
頑張ってー！
Good luck!

722
01:05:41,984 --> 01:05:44,384
はい！バイバーイ！
Thank you! Bye-bye!

723
01:05:46,284 --> 01:05:48,584
よいしょ...
Alright...

724
01:05:48,584 --> 01:05:54,384
あーもうmiwaさん、可愛いし、美しいし、歌声は素晴らしいし、もう素敵ですし、本当にもうどうしたんだ、何だニコたん...
Ah, miwa-san is so cute, beautiful, has such a wonderful voice, and is just amazing... What's gotten into you, Niko-tan...?

725
01:05:54,384 --> 01:05:56,384
ふぅー...
Phew...

726
01:05:56,384 --> 01:06:01,284
ということで 新曲を歌うために ステージ移動したいと思います
And with that, I'm going to move over to the stage to perform my new song.

727
01:06:01,284 --> 01:06:04,384
聴いてください。「星炎」。
Please listen. "Seien."

728
01:06:23,584 --> 01:06:31,584
Ah...

729
01:06:33,384 --> 01:06:37,784
自信なんてなかった ひとりだってよかった
I had no confidence; I thought being alone was fine

730
01:06:37,784 --> 01:06:41,384
プライドに隠れて
Hiding behind my pride

731
01:06:41,384 --> 01:06:45,584
誰かの視線 気になってばかりで
Always worrying about what others thought,

732
01:06:45,584 --> 01:06:49,084
閉じこもってた
I locked myself away

733
01:06:49,384 --> 01:06:53,584
綺麗だなんて思えなくて
Unable to see the beauty,

734
01:06:53,584 --> 01:06:57,184
笑えなかったんだ
I couldn't even smile

735
01:06:57,184 --> 01:07:01,384
涙で滲んだ 画面の向こう
Beyond the screen blurred with tears

736
01:07:01,384 --> 01:07:04,584
ふいに溶けた心
My frozen heart melted,

737
01:07:04,584 --> 01:07:08,084
触れてくれた声
touched by your voice

738
01:07:08,084 --> 01:07:12,084
「君のおかげで笑えたよ」
"Thanks to you, I was able to smile"

739
01:07:12,084 --> 01:07:16,084
その言葉がずっと
Those words have always

740
01:07:16,084 --> 01:07:19,784
この胸を灯す
kept a light burning in my heart,

741
01:07:19,784 --> 01:07:24,584
ただひとつの光
as my one and only light

742
01:07:24,584 --> 01:07:29,084
Fire, take me higher

743
01:07:29,084 --> 01:07:32,984
消えそうな声を歌に変えて
Turning my fading voice into song,

744
01:07:32,984 --> 01:07:37,084
弱さ 抱きしめながら
while embracing my weakness

745
01:07:37,084 --> 01:07:48,584
届けと叫ぶように 燃やす炎
I ignite this blazing flame, shouting for it to reach you

746
01:07:48,584 --> 01:07:52,984
Fire, take me higher

747
01:07:52,984 --> 01:07:59,084
君の明日を照らしたい
I want to illuminate your tomorrow

748
01:08:05,384 --> 01:08:09,984
救われたくて 100以上出し切って
Desperate to be saved, giving more than 100%,

749
01:08:09,984 --> 01:08:13,384
疲れ果てた夜
on those exhausted nights

750
01:08:13,384 --> 01:08:17,084
大事なものって何だったんだっけ
What was it that truly mattered?

751
01:08:17,084 --> 01:08:20,084
忘れそうになるの
I almost forget

752
01:08:20,084 --> 01:08:24,384
振り返る足跡
Looking back at my footprints,

753
01:08:24,384 --> 01:08:28,084
あの頃の自分に会いたい
I want to meet who I was back then

754
01:08:28,084 --> 01:08:32,084
もう戻れなくても
Even if I can never go back,

755
01:08:32,084 --> 01:08:35,784
素直になりたい
I want to be true to myself

756
01:08:35,784 --> 01:08:40,784
失くしたくないから
because I don't want to lose it

757
01:08:40,784 --> 01:08:45,084
Fire, take me higher

758
01:08:45,084 --> 01:08:49,084
君への想い 歌に乗せて
Carrying my feelings for you in song,

759
01:08:49,084 --> 01:08:53,084
怖さ 受け止めながら
while embracing my fear

760
01:08:53,084 --> 01:09:04,584
響けと祈るように 燃やす炎
I ignite this blazing flame, praying for it to resonate

761
01:09:04,584 --> 01:09:09,084
Fire, take me higher

762
01:09:09,084 --> 01:09:14,584
君の笑顔を灯したい
I want to light up your smile

763
01:09:14,584 --> 01:09:19,084
壊れそうな夜をこえて
Overcoming fragile nights,

764
01:09:19,084 --> 01:09:22,784
逃げ出しそうな朝をぬけて
pushing through mornings I wanted to run from,

765
01:09:22,784 --> 01:09:30,084
いま ここにいる
right now, I am here

766
01:09:30,084 --> 01:09:34,384
私のつくる世界で
If in this world I create,

767
01:09:34,384 --> 01:09:39,084
君が笑ってくれるなら
you can smile,

768
01:09:39,084 --> 01:09:43,384
この声が生まれた理由
that's the reason this voice was born—

769
01:09:43,384 --> 01:09:48,584
胸にともる星炎
the starry blaze lighting up my heart

770
01:09:48,584 --> 01:09:53,084
Fire, take me higher

771
01:09:53,084 --> 01:09:56,784
私に意味をくれた君へ
To you, who gave me meaning,

772
01:09:56,784 --> 01:10:00,584
声は届いてますか
is my voice reaching you?

773
01:10:00,905 --> 01:10:04,505
これからもずっと歩き続けたい
I want to keep walking forward forever

774
01:10:04,505 --> 01:10:08,805
Fire, take me higher

775
01:10:08,805 --> 01:10:13,005
消えそうな声を歌に変えて
Turning my fading voice into a song,

776
01:10:13,005 --> 01:10:17,105
弱さを抱きしめながら
while embracing my weaknesses,

777
01:10:17,105 --> 01:10:21,305
届けと叫ぶように燃やす
burning like a cry to reach you,

778
01:10:21,305 --> 01:10:28,105
炎
this flame

779
01:10:28,305 --> 01:10:32,705
Fire, take me higher

780
01:10:32,705 --> 01:10:37,705
君の明日を照らしたい
I want to light up your tomorrow

781
01:10:45,105 --> 01:10:50,805
Ah

782
01:10:57,505 --> 01:11:03,105
ニコたんの歌を聴いてくれて、ありがとう
Thank you for listening to Niko-tan's song.

783
01:11:07,305 --> 01:11:34,305
ご来場ありがとうございました！！
Thank you so much for coming!!

